  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - Kelasi Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kelasi is a web application, also available as an android application aimed to virtualize the whole learning content of high-school program, and make it available to the students on the need., Kelasi is not only about giving student e-learning content, but its aimed to bring our national education system to a new level, where the whole learning environment is designed around the learner, adding to the existing system a self-oriented learning environment.,</narrative>
  </description>
